# The JavaFX SDK is ~54 MB of platform-specific binaries, so it is not committed.
# Download openjfx-25.0.1_osx-aarch64_bin-sdk.zip from https://gluonhq.com/products/javafx/
# and unzip it here, so that this directory contains javafx-sdk-25.0.1/lib/.
# See ../../../../README.md for setup notes.
javafx-sdk-*/

# The JDBC and logging jars are small and are committed, so that the project
# compiles straight after a clone.
!*.jar
